// over `T`; both `i32` and `String` reproduce.
//
// Discovered while attempting to migrate `package-gale/src/follow_env.wado`'s
// `FollowSet.kinds` from `Array<String>` to `TreeSet<String>` for an
// O(n²) → O(n log n) speedup on the FOLLOW fixed-point. The migration
// was reverted (TreeSet is now used as an internal accelerator inside
// the existing Array-keyed API instead) until this ICE is fixed.
//
// Likely culprit: the `IntoIterator` impl on `&TreeSet<T>` /
// `&TreeMap<K, V>` lowers to a Wasm GC reference whose nullability the
// WIR layer treats inconsistently — the inner traversal expects a
// `(ref null $type)` slot but the iterator hands back `(ref $type)`.
// `Array<T>`'s by-ref iter doesn't trip this, so the divergence is in
// the BTree-based collections' iterator type.

